    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n74715" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπως οὖν</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁπωσοῦν</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in any
